  "question": "A car starts from rest and accelerates uniformly at 2m/s. Find its velocity after 10 seconds.",
  "gold_answer": "```python\nu = 0\na = 2\nt = 10\nv = u + a * t\nprint(f\"v = {v}\")\n\n\n\n```\n\n```text\nv = 20\n\n\n```\n\n# Solved Numerical\n\n---\n\n## Kinematics Problem\n\n### Problem\n\nA car starts from rest and accelerates uniformly at $2 \\text{ m/s}^2$. Find its velocity after 10 seconds.\n\n### Given\n\n* Initial velocity ($u$) = $0 \\text{ m/s}$\n* Uniform acceleration ($a$) = $2 \\text{ m/s}^2$\n* Time taken ($t$) = $10 \\text{ s}$\n\n### Formula\n\n$$v = u + at$$\n\n### Substitution\n\n$$v = 0 + (2 \\times 10)$$\n\n### Calculation\n\n$$v = 0 + 20$$\n\n$$v = 20$$\n\n### Final Answer\n\n**Final Velocity ($v$) = $20 \\text{ m/s}$**\n\n### Interpretation\n\nThis means that after starting from a complete standstill and accelerating steadily at a rate of $2 \\text{ m/s}^2$ for $10 \\text{ seconds}$, the car reaches a speed of $20 \\text{ meters per second}$ in its direction of motion.",
  "candidate_response": "<div class=\"tutor-response\">\n\n## Uniform Acceleration Problem\n\n<div class=\"card intro-card\">\n  <div class=\"card-label\">📘 What's Happening</div>\n  <p>A car begins at <strong>rest</strong> (zero initial velocity) and gains speed at a <em>constant rate</em>. We need to find how fast it's moving after a set time.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"card definition-card\">\n  <div class=\"card-label\">📖 Key Terms</div>\n  <div class=\"term-grid\">\n    <div class=\"term-item\">\n      <span class=\"term-name\">Uniform Acceleration</span>\n      <span class=\"term-desc\">Velocity increases by the same amount every second</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"term-item\">\n      <span class=\"term-name\">Starts from Rest</span>\n      <span class=\"term-desc\">Initial velocity u = 0 m/s</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"card given-card\">\n  <div class=\"card-label\">📋 Given Information</div>\n  <div class=\"given-grid\">\n    <div class=\"given-row\">\n      <span class=\"given-symbol\">u</span>\n      <span class=\"given-equals\">=</span>\n      <span class=\"given-value\">0 m/s</span>\n      <span class=\"given-note\">starts from rest</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"given-row\">\n      <span class=\"given-symbol\">a</span>\n      <span class=\"given-equals\">=</span>\n      <span class=\"given-value\">2 m/s²</span>\n      <span class=\"given-note\">uniform acceleration</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"given-row\">\n      <span class=\"given-symbol\">t</span>\n      <span class=\"given-equals\">=</span>\n      <span class=\"given-value\">10 s</span>\n      <span class=\"given-note\">time elapsed</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"given-row find-row\">\n      <span class=\"given-symbol\">v</span>\n      <span class=\"given-equals\">=</span>\n      <span class=\"given-value\">?</span>\n      <span class=\"given-note\">find this</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"card formula-card\">\n  <div class=\"card-label\">⚡ Formula Used</div>\n  <div class=\"formula-name\">First Equation of Motion</div>\n  <div class=\"formula-display\" id=\"formula-main\">\n    \\[ v = u + at \\]\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"formula-variables\">\n    <div class=\"var-row\"><span class=\"var\">v</span> = final velocity (m/s)</div>\n    <div class=\"var-row\"><span class=\"var\">u</span> = initial velocity (m/s)</div>\n    <div class=\"var-row\"><span class=\"var\">a</span> = acceleration (m/s²)</div>\n    <div class=\"var-row\"><span class=\"var\">t</span> = time (s)</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"card solution-card\">\n  <div class=\"card-label\">🔢 Step-by-Step Solution</div>\n  <div class=\"step\">\n    <div class=\"step-number\">1</div>\n    <div class=\"step-content\">\n      <div class=\"step-label\">Write the formula</div>\n      <div class=\"step-math\">\\[ v = u + at \\]</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"step\">\n    <div class=\"step-number\">2</div>\n    <div class=\"step-content\">\n      <div class=\"step-label\">Substitute the values</div>\n      <div class=\"step-math\">\\[ v = 0 + (2)(10) \\]</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"step\">\n    <div class=\"step-number\">3</div>\n    <div class=\"step-content\">\n      <div class=\"step-label\">Simplify</div>\n      <div class=\"step-math\">\\[ v = 20 \\text{ m/s} \\]</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"card answer-card\">\n  <div class=\"answer-label\">✅ Final Answer</div>\n  <div class=\"answer-value\">\\[ v = 20 \\text{ m/s} \\]</div>\n  <div class=\"answer-note\">The car is travelling at <strong>20 metres per second</strong> after 10 seconds.</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"card insight-card\">\n  <div class=\"card-label\">💡 Quick Insight</div>\n  <p>Since the car accelerates at <strong>2 m/s²</strong>, it gains <strong>2 m/s of speed every second</strong>. After 10 seconds, that's simply 2 × 10 = 20 m/s. The zero initial velocity made this especially clean!</p>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<